# ============================================================================
# Vercel Deployment Ignore (.vercelignore)
# Prevents uploading non-frontend services, test suites, docs, and scratch files
#
# IMPORTANT: every path below is anchored to the repo root with a leading
# slash. Without the leading slash, gitignore-style matching applies the
# pattern at ANY depth — e.g. an unanchored `money-service/` also excludes
# `lib/money-service/`, the Next.js app's own client module for talking to
# that service, breaking the build. This bit us once (see git history);
# keep every root-directory entry below anchored.
# ============================================================================

# Testing suites & reports
# (left unanchored: these are generic folder-naming conventions with no
# real production directory sharing the name, and we want them excluded
# at every depth, e.g. component-colocated __tests__ folders)
__tests__/
__mocks__/

/coverage/
/e2e/
/e2e-testing/
/k6-tests/
/postman/
/test-results/
/playwright-report/

